    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always found math practical and intuitive, especially in physics and everyday problem-solving. My vocational diploma taught me basics, but I’ve built confidence through hobbies like rock climbing—where calculating angles and forces matters. I see math as a tool, not a rigid system.",
