    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes, I used AI tools like Khan Academy and Wolfram Alpha to check my physics homework. They helped me visualize equations and catch errors quickly. I found them user-friendly but preferred hands-on practice over automated answers.",
